                        "entry_id": "9c256b63-ce9e-3b35-97f4-a9e24fe4a28f",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "sanguinolentes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2ee8f98f-b3af-3c06-b697-5ca191823bba",
                        "entry_id": "9c256b63-ce9e-3b35-97f4-a9e24fe4a28f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui est teinté de sang, où se mêle du sang."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e6091b4b-f096-4c4c-b624-28fd12119dfb",
                                "sense_id": "2ee8f98f-b3af-3c06-b697-5ca191823bba",
                                "text": "Crachats sanguinolents."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "159e2ebf-d2b0-40c5-ad69-ff647990fe59",
                                "sense_id": "2ee8f98f-b3af-3c06-b697-5ca191823bba",
                                "text": "Le soir, les maisons de jeu n’ont qu’une poésie vulgaire, mais dont l’effet est assuré comme celui d’un drame sanguinolent."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "732848ed-e905-4cd0-9e47-3f3fb4af5b57",
                                "sense_id": "2ee8f98f-b3af-3c06-b697-5ca191823bba",
                                "text": "Le palais de Frédéric IV est d’un goût plus allemand et plus moderne. Deux grands pignons à frontons et à volutes se font pendant sur sa façade, d’un grès plus sanguinolent et moins festonné de lierre que celui du palais d’Othon-Henri."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "61379bc8-4431-457a-86fb-c0288235d27e",
                                "sense_id": "2ee8f98f-b3af-3c06-b697-5ca191823bba",
                                "text": "Des bébêtes sanguinolentes\nMolles comme une omelette\nDes machins qui se traînent mi-chenille mi-humain\nDes trucs pas câlins qu’ont toujours super faim"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "315d2fbd-d1b5-4bc1-b722-821462ee185c",
                        "source_entry_id": "9c256b63-ce9e-3b35-97f4-a9e24fe4a28f",
                        "source_sense_id": "2ee8f98f-b3af-3c06-b697-5ca191823bba",
                        "target_lang_word": "sanguinolent",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sanguinolent",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3f9962ae-e321-3866-8f70-96a1b5b52e27",
                                        "entry_id": "4e720ab4-bf97-3b76-a37b-0bf14b5101ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Containing or tinged with blood."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d4fde788-1b00-4d64-81e7-d4c8e1891b28",
                                                "sense_id": "3f9962ae-e321-3866-8f70-96a1b5b52e27",
                                                "text": "On making a larger opening there issued three or four pints of a very sanguinolent fluid."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "73e241f9-61bf-4b0e-8ad9-7c9bcaf85f2f",
                                                "sense_id": "3f9962ae-e321-3866-8f70-96a1b5b52e27",
                                                "text": "When the desire to urinate manifests itself chiefly at night, with burning pains when urinating, or emission, drop by drop, of sanguinolent urine."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c1d133f1-612f-4699-b7f6-7ac9b8548570",
                                                "sense_id": "3f9962ae-e321-3866-8f70-96a1b5b52e27",
                                                "text": "He still walked about London with his dreams, but as months succeeded months and he left the year behind him they were dreams not so much of success as of revenge. Success seemed a colourless name for the reward of his patience; something fiercely florid, something sanguinolent was more to the point."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d2cf910c-c658-4aa0-8588-18c9434e0a91",
                                                "sense_id": "3f9962ae-e321-3866-8f70-96a1b5b52e27",
                                                "text": "They are caused by an accumulation of blood or sanguinolent liquid inside the dental follicles, they may occur in the deciduous as well as permanent dentition."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
